invariant: INV-69
file: src/mldsa_neon.c
catches: test/docker-aes-runtime-qemu.sh keccak-neon
reason: the ML-DSA-87 sampler absorbs rho || i || j for entry A[i][j], the
  stream of A[j][i]. The equivalence test compares each entry with
  mld_sample_ntt's for every row and first entry.

--- old
    keccak_neon_shake128_start(&state, rho, x0, x1, cpu);
--- new
    keccak_neon_shake128_start(&state, rho, x1, x0, cpu);
